WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:08.539
Ashley Christian: A new website is supposed to be exciting, but my septic client was nervous and they had a point.

2
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:27.630
Ashley Christian: A septic company we work with is getting ready for a new website. They told me what worried them about the switch, so I walk them through every step we take on launch day. Most of those steps we actually learned the hard way. Launch day is when the leads can quietly disappear through a form that looks fine but actually sends nowhere.

3
00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:34.520
Ashley Christian: A good looking site is the easy part. Making sure every lead still reaches your job is the real work.

4
00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:42.230
Ashley Christian: If you're switching websites, ask your designer how they'll prove your form works on day one. If they don't have an answer, send me a message.

